 seating arrangement for up to 5 occupants. With a 12.8 in. screen stands out, enhanced by wireless Android Auto, wireless Apple CarPlay for seamless connectivity. Safety and durability are paramount, with the vehicle backed by a 48/50000 year basic warranty. The Mercedes-Benz S-Class is as sturdy as it is sophisticated, ready to meet the demands of modern drivers. Body Type Sedan Engine 3.0L Turbo I6 442hp 413ft. lbs. Drivetrain AWD Horse Power 442 MPG 21 /31 /24 Doors 4 View Mercedes-Benz S-Class Inventory Locate Mercedes-Benz Dealers Engine & Transmission Fuel & Performance Suspension, Steering & Brakes Dimension & Capacity Warranty Entertainment Interior Comfort & Convenience Exterior Safety Specifications Select Trim Select Trim Engine & Transmission Engine Name 3.0L Turbo I6 442hp 413ft. lbs. Cylinders 6 Aspiration Turbo Compression 10.5 Displacement 3 Valve timing VVT Max hp 442 @5800 Max torque 413 @2200 Engine type Internal Combustion Cam type DOHC Valves 24 Transmission Name 9-Speed Shiftable Automatic Transmission Style Shiftable Automatic Fuel & Performance Fuel type Gasoline Combined MPG 24 Highway MPG 31 City MPG 21 Fuel Grade Premium Fuel quality 91 Fuel induction DI 4WD type full time Auto start/stop Yes Battery maintenance-free Suspension, Steering & Brakes Front shock type gas Front spring type pneumatic Front suspension classification independent Front suspension type multi-link Rear shock type gas Rear spring type pneumatic Rear suspension classification independent Rear suspension type multi-link Suspension control electronic Dimension & Capacity Wheelbase 126.6 Height 59.2 Ground Clearance 5.1 Width 83.0 Front Track Width 65.2 Rear Track Width 65.0 Length 208.2 Cargo Volume 12.8 Passenger Volume 107.0 Max Payload 1477 Gross Vehicle Weight Range 6001-7000 Curb Weight 4740 Fuel Tank Capacity 20.0 Gross Vehicle Weight Rating 6217 Head Room 1st Row 42.1 Head Room 2nd Row/Rear 39.4 Shoulder Room 1st Row 59.6 Shoulder Room 2nd Row/Rear 59.0 Leg Room 