xury and superior craftsmanship. The 2024 S-Class continues this legacy, maintaining its role as a leader in the luxury sedan segment . What's New in the 2024 S-Class? Photo Credit: Mercedes-Benz. The 2024 S-Class introduces a plethora of enhancements over its predecessor. From updated technology to design refinements, it aims to redefine luxury driving. Mercedes-Benz has incorporated cutting-edge features that elevate comfort and style. Key updates in the 2024 S-Class include: Advanced infotainment systems for seamless connectivity Enhanced driver assistance technologies for added safety New powertrain options emphasizing efficiency These changes underscore the brand's commitment to innovation. By focusing on future mobility trends, the 2024 S-Class stands out in its class. With these developments, Mercedes-Benz reinforces its reputation as a pioneer in luxury. Exterior Evolution Photo Credit: Mercedes-Benz. The exterior of the 2024 S-Class exudes sophistication and elegance. It features subtle yet refined exterior updates, including two new paint finishes: Verde Silver Metallic and Velvet Brown Metallic. These enhancements add to its luxurious appeal, maintaining its elegant and timeless design while offering a fresh look for the flagship sedan. Its streamlined design enhances aerodynamics, contributing to improved performance and fuel efficiency. Subtle changes, like redesigned headlights and grille, create a bold presence. The bodywork epitomizes refined luxury with smooth lines and a modern silhouette. Mercedes-Benz has struck a balance between tradition and innovation. This makes the 2024 S-Class visually stunning yet instantly recognizable as an S-Class. Interior Luxury and Comfort Photo Credit: Mercedes-Benz. Inside, the 2024 S-Class offers unparalleled luxury and comfort. High-quality materials and meticulous craftsmanship define the cabin, creating a serene atmosphere. The design focuses on providing a sense of spaciousness and opulence. New interior features include ambient lighting and ergonomic seating. These elements enhance passenger comfort, making long journeys more enjoy\", 'images': [], 'rank': 1}, {'url': 'https://www.cardealerships.com/car-research/mercedes-benz/s-class/2025/specs', 'content': \"2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs, Features & Options Hello Select Location Cars For Sale Car Dealers Car Research Car Compare Blogs Sell My Car Dealer Sign In Dealer Sign Up 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs and Options Change Make & Model Car Starting MSRP*: $117750 Overview Specs Compare Trims 2026 2025 2024 2023 2022 2021 2020 2019 2018 2017 2016 2015 2014 2013 2012 2011 2010 2009 2008 2007 2006 2005 2004 2003 2002 2001 2000 1999 1998 1997 1996 1995 1994 Body Type Sedan Engine 3.0L Turbo I6 442hp 413ft. lbs. Drivetrain AWD Horse Power 442 MPG 21 /31 /24 Doors 4 The 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class stands out as a remarkable Sedan that skillfully blends utility with style. Priced between $117750 and $240500 , it offers a range of features tailored for diverse buyers. This model boasts a ground clearance of 5.1 inches and is available in 5 different trims, including AWD S 500 4MATIC 4dr Sedan, AWD S 580e 4MATIC 4dr Sedan, AWD S 580 4MATIC 4dr Sedan, AWD AMG S 63 E Performance 4MATIC 4dr Sedan, AWD Mercedes-Maybach S 580 4MATIC 4dr Sedan, each designed to cater to unique preferences. Under the hood, the S-Class is powered by a 4.0L Plug-in Hybrid Twin Turbo V8 791hp 1055ft. lbs. engine, delivering 604 horsepower and 1055 @2500 lb-ft of torque. The robust powertrain is complemented by a Shiftable Automatic 9-Speed Shiftable Automatic , ensuring responsive and smooth shifts. The drivetrain options enhance its adaptability, perfect for varying driving conditions. It's designed with practicality in mind, featuring a payload capacity of 1477 and , making it a strong contender for both work-related tasks and weekend adventures. The interior is no less impressive, offering a passenger volume of 107.0 cubic feet and a comfortable seating arrangement for up to 5 occupants. With a 12.8 in. screen stands out, enhanced by wireless Android Auto, wireless Apple CarPlay for seamless connectivity. Safety and durability are paramount, with the vehicle backed by a 48/50000 year basic warranty. The Mercedes-Benz S-Class is as sturdy as it is sophisticated, ready to meet the demands of modern drivers. Body Type Sedan Engine 3.0L Turbo I6 442hp 413ft. lbs. Drivetrain AWD Horse Power 442 MPG 21 /31 /24 Doors 4 View Mercedes-Benz S-Class Inventory Locate Mercedes-Benz Dealers Engine & Transmission Fuel & Performance Suspension, Steering & Brakes Dimension & Capacity Warranty Entertainment Interior Comfort & Convenience Exterior Safety Specifications Select Trim Select Trim Engine & Transmission Engine Name 3.0L Turbo I6 442hp 413ft. lbs. Cylinders 6 Aspiration Turbo Compression 10.5 Displacement 3 Valve timing VVT Max hp 442 @5800 Max torque 413 @2200 Engine type Internal Combustion Cam type DOHC Valves 24 Transmission Name 9-Speed Shiftable Automatic Transmission Style Shiftable Automatic Fuel & Performance Fuel type Gasoline Combined MPG 24 Highway MPG 31 City MPG 21 Fuel Grade Premium Fuel quality 91 Fuel induction DI 4WD type full time Auto start/stop Yes Battery maintenance-free Suspension, Steering & Brakes Front shock type gas Front spring type pneumatic Front suspension classification independent Front suspension type multi-link Rear shock type gas Rear spring type pneumatic Rear suspension classification independent Rear suspension type multi-link Suspension control electronic Dimension & Capacity Wheelbase 126.6 Height 59.2 Ground Clearance 5.1 Width 83.0 Front Track Width 65.2 Rear Track Width 65.0 Length 208.2 Cargo Volume 12.8 Passenger Volume 107.0 Max Payload 1477 Gross Vehicle Weight Range 6001-7000 Curb Weight 4740 Fuel Tank Capacity 20.0 Gross Vehicle Weight Rating 6217 Head Room 1st Row 42.1 Head Room 2nd Row/Rear 39.4 Shoulder Room 1st Row 59.6 Shoulder Room 2nd Row/Rear 59.0 Leg Room 1st Row 41.4 Standard Seating 5 Max Seating 5 Seating Rows 2 Leg Room 2nd Row/Rear 43.8 Front Tire Description 255/45R19 Rear Tire Description 255/45R19 Front Wheel Size 19.0 x 8.5 Rear Wheel Size 19.0 x 8.5 Front Wheel Diameter 19.0 Front Wheel Width 8.5\", 'images': [], 'rank': 2}, {'url': 'https://www.caranddriver.com/mercedes-benz/s-class/specs', 'content': 'Skip to Content Global Nav Search SUBSCRIBE SIGN IN RESEARCH CARS EXPERT REVIEWS SHOPPING TOOLS WHATS MY CAR WORTH? EXPERT-TESTED GEAR NEWS + STORIES MAINTENANCE HomeMercedes-BenzS-ClassSpecs 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class S 500 4MATIC Sedan Features And Specs Year* 2025 Style, Configuration, Engine Options* Mercedes-Benz S-Class Trim* S 500 S 500 4MATIC Sedan OVERVIEW S 500 S 500 4MATIC Sedan Package Includes PRICE STARTING AT $118,900 Vehicle EPA Classification Large Cars Drivetrain All-Wheel Drive Engine Engine Order Code NA Engine Type and Required Fuel Intercooled Turbo Gas/Electric I-6 Displacement (liters/cubic inches) 3.0 L/183 Fuel System Gasoline Direct Injection Maximum Horsepower @ RPM 442 Maximum Torque @ RPM 413 Cooling System Capacity (quarts) NA Transmission Transmission Order Code NA Transmission Description Automatic w/OD Number of Transmission Speeds 9 First Gear Ratio (:1) 5.50 Second Gear Ratio (:1) 3.33 Third Gear Ratio (:1) 2.31 Fourth Gear Ratio (:1) 1.66 Fifth Gear Ratio (:1) 1.21 Sixth Gear Ratio (:1) 1.00 Seventh Gear Ratio (:1) 0.86 Eighth Gear Ratio (:1) 0.72 Ninth Gear Ratio (:1) NA Reverse Ratio (:1) 4.93 Final Drive Axle Ratio (:1) NA Clutch Size NA ADVERTISEMENT - CONTINUE READING BELOW Fuel Economy and Range EPA Greenhouse Gas Score 5.0 CO2 Emissions, 15K mi/year (tons) 7.3 Range, city/highway (miles) 420.00 / 620.00 EPA Fuel Economy, combined/city/highway (mpg) 24 / 21 / 31 Fuel Tank Fuel Capacity / Gas Tank Size 20 Aux Fuel Tank Capacity (gallons) NA Exterior Dimensions Wheelbase (inches) 126.6 Length (inches) 208.2 Width, without mirrors (inches) 76.9 Height (inches) 59.2 Fro