-Benz S-Class sedan 2022 Mercedes-Benz S-class Sedan 2021 Mercedes-Benz S-class Sedan 2021 Mercerdes-Benz S560 Cabriolet 2021 Mercerdes-Benz S560 Coupe 2020 Mercedes-Benz S450 / S560 sedan 2020 Mercedes-Benz S560 Cabriolet 2020 Mercedes-Benz S560 Coupe 2020 Mercedes-Benz S560e Sedan 2019 Mercedes-Benz S450 / S560 sedan 2019 Mercedes-Benz S560 Cabriolet 2019 Mercedes-Be', 'images': [], 'rank': 3}, {'url': 'https://digestley.com/2021-mercedes-s-class/', 'content': 'A Complete Breakdown of the 2021 Mercedes S-Class, Design Behance Facebook Twitter Vimeo VKontakte Sign in Home Improvement Technology Lifestyle Fashion Food Law Business Digital Marketing Automobile Real Estate Entertainment More Pets Education Sport Gaming Education Photography Travel Health Sign in Welcome! Log into your account your username your password Forgot your password? Password recovery Recover your password your email Search Sign in / Join Behance Facebook Twitter Vimeo VKontakte Sign in Welcome! Log into your account your username your password Forgot your password? Get help Password recovery Recover your password your email A password will be e-mailed to you. Digestley Home Improvement Technology Lifestyle Fashion Food Law Business Digital Marketing Automobile Real Estate Entertainment More Pets Education Sport Gaming Education Photography Travel Health Home Automobile A Complete Breakdown of the 2021 Mercedes S-Class: Specs, Design, Engine, Features,... Automobile A Complete Breakdown of the 2021 Mercedes S-Class: Specs, Design, Engine, Features, and Expert Impression By Muhammad Binyameen - April 24, 2025 135 0 Facebook Twitter Pinterest WhatsApp Table of Contents Toggle Introduction Exterior Design: Elegance Refined Sophisticated Styling 2021 Mercedes S-Class Interior Design Materials and Craftsmanship Comfort and Space Powertrain and Engine Performance Engine Options Performance Metrics Technology and Infotainment Rear Seat Technology Safety and Driver Assistance Driving Assistance Package Ride Quality and Handling Expert Impressions Critics Praise Real-World Driving Trim Levels and Options Pricing and Value Ownership Experience Warranty and Maintenance Longevity and Resale Conclusion FAQs Introduction The 2021 Mercedes S-Class isnt just a luxury sedanits a flagship statement of what modern automotive innovation should be. Known for its refinement, cutting-edge technology, and sumptuous comfort, the S-Class has consistently raised the bar for whats expected in executive sedans. The 2021 model continues this tradition with dramatic design upgrades, an advanced MBUX infotainment system, and next-level driver-assistance features. This article comprehensively examines the 2021 Mercedes S-Class, examining every detail from design and engine to expert impressions and real-world performance. Category Details Model Name 2021 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Available Trims S 500 4MATIC, S 580 4MATIC Engine Options 3.0L I6 turbo w/ EQ Boost (429 hp), 4.0L V8 Biturbo w/ EQ Boost (496 hp) Torque 384 lb-ft (S 500), 516 lb-ft (S 580) Transmission 9-speed automatic Drivetrain Standard 4MATIC all-wheel drive 060 mph Time ~4.4 seconds (S 580) Top Speed Electronically limited to 130 mph Fuel Economy (MPG) ~1721 city / 2630 highway Exterior Design Sleek silhouette, Digital Light LEDs, the aerodynamic drag coefficient of 0.22 Interior Highlights Nappa leather, wood/aluminium trim, ambient lighting, panoramic sunroof Infotainment System 12.8 OLED touchscreen, MBUX 2.0, voice control, AR navigation Rear Seat Tech Up to 3 rear screens, rear MBUX tablet Driver Assistance Adaptive cruise, lane keep assist, emergency braking, rear-axle steering. Suspension System AIRMATIC with E-Active Body Control Rear-Axle Steering Yes, up to 10 rotation for a tighter turning radius Safety Innovations Pre-Safe Impulse Side, advanced airbag deployment Trim Options Executive Line, Warmth & Comfort, Night Package, Rear Entertainment Base Price ~$110,000 (S 500), ~$117,000 (S 580) Max Price (Fully Loaded) ~$140,000+ Warranty 4 years / 50,000 miles limited warranty Expert Verdict Benchmark for luxury sedans, unmatched ride, tech, and refinement Exterior Design: Elegance Refined Sophisticated Styling The 2021 S-Class adopts a sleeker, more minimalist exterior than its predecessor. Smooth lines, a stretched silhouette, and a gracefully contoured hood give it a stately presence. The grille is bold but elegant, flanked by LED Digital Light headlamps that offer impres', 'images': [], 'rank': 4}, {'url': 'https://www.kbb.com/mercedes-benz/s-class/2025/specs/', 'content': \"2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs & Feature Comparisons | Kelley Blue Book Car Values Price New/Used My Car's Value Instant Cash Offer Cars for Sale Cars for Sale Free Dealer Price Quote Vehicle History Report Find Local Dealers Private Seller Exchange Private Seller Cars Sell Your Car Shop & Buy Best Cars Dealer Reviews KBB Expert Reviews Electric Vehicle Guide KBB Awards Latest Car News Shopping & Buying Research Tools Car Research Browse Incentives Car Loan Calculator Car Finder Compare Cars Car Loans Insurance Check My Credit Extended Warranty Vehicle History Report Car Repair Auto Repair Prices Car Recalls Maintenance Pricing Find an Auto Shop Service Advisor OBD-II Codes Home Mercedes-Benz Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs and Features 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs, Features & Options Here's everything you need to know about each trim in the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class lineup. Compare pricing, specs, key features and more. More About the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-class Save 1 of 3 S-Class S 500 4MATIC Save 2 of 3 S-Class S 580e 4MATIC Save 3 of 3 S-Class S 580 4MATIC See Pricing See Cars in Stock See Pricing See Cars in Stock See Pricing See Cars in Stock MSRP $118,900 $129,350 $129,750 Fuel Economy City 21/Hwy 31/Comb 24 MPG Comb 23 MPG City 18/Hwy 27/Comb 21 MPG Fuel Type Gas Hybrid LeafIcon Gas Horsepower 442 HP 510 @ 5500 RPM 496 HP Engine 6-Cyl, MHEV, Turbo, 3.0 Liter 6-Cyl, Hybrid, Turbo, 3.0 Liter V