 steering. Suspension System AIRMATIC with E-Active Body Control Rear-Axle Steering Yes, up to 10 rotation for a tighter turning radius Safety Innovations Pre-Safe Impulse Side, advanced airbag deployment Trim Options Executive Line, Warmth & Comfort, Night Package, Rear Entertainment Base Price ~$110,000 (S 500), ~$117,000 (S 580) Max Price (Fully Loaded) ~$140,000+ Warranty 4 years / 50,000 miles limited warranty Expert Verdict Benchmark for luxury sedans, unmatched ride, tech, and refinement Exterior Design: Elegance Refined Sophisticated Styling The 2021 S-Class adopts a sleeker, more minimalist exterior than its predecessor. Smooth lines, a stretched silhouette, and a gracefully contoured hood give it a stately presence. The grille is bold but elegant, flanked by LED Digital Light headlamps that offer impres\\\', \\\'images\\\': [], \\\'rank\\\': 4}, {\\\'url\\\': \\\'https://www.kbb.com/mercedes-benz/s-class/2025/specs/\\\', \\\'content\\\': "2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs & Feature Comparisons | Kelley Blue Book Car Values Price New/Used My Car\\\'s Value Instant Cash Offer Cars for Sale Cars for Sale Free Dealer Price Quote Vehicle History Report Find Local Dealers Private Seller Exchange Private Seller Cars Sell Your Car Shop & Buy Best Cars Dealer Reviews KBB Expert Reviews Electric Vehicle Guide KBB Awards Latest Car News Shopping & Buying Research Tools Car Research Browse Incentives Car Loan Calculator Car Finder Compare Cars Car Loans Insurance Check My Credit Extended Warranty Vehicle History Report Car Repair Auto Repair Prices Car Recalls Maintenance Pricing Find an Auto Shop Service Advisor OBD-II Codes Home Mercedes-Benz Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs and Features 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class Specs, Features & Options Here\\\'s everything you need to know about each trim in the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-Class lineup. Compare pricing, specs, key features and more. More About the 2025 Mercedes-Benz S-class Save 1 of 3 S-Class S 500 4MATIC Save 2 of 3 S-Clas